Box 51184, conv 49179: the goal's plan wrote to nobody (D626: saved as a
draft, no card). The owner then typed „ჰკითხე ნიკას" for the contact saved
as „ნიკა ხელოსანი". The waiting draft refuses every ask except the person
the owner's own line names, and that match needs the whole label in the
line, so the ask was refused and the owner said yes twice more before it
went.

When no whole label is in the line, a first name it names (in any case
ending) now counts if exactly one of the owner's contacts has a label
starting with it and that is this person. Two contacts with the name still
name nobody, as before.

